      <Desc>ARTS EDUCATION - Our Arts Education reaches students ages 4-18 through varied programs serving all of San Diego County. It consists of full-scale productions, workshop productions, classes, school partnerships, and teen leadership initiatives. In 2024-2025, more than 1,500 students were engaged, with over 3,000 patrons attending productions and showcase performances through the combination of classes and programs.</Desc>
      <ProgSrvcAccomActy2Grp>
