        <RevenueAmt>208972</RevenueAmt>
        <Desc>GROWN UP STAGE - Our Grown Up Stage is our professional theatre branch, employing artists to create theatrical productions. In consists of our GUS productions, Storytime, and co-productions &amp; rentals. In 2024, we welcomed over 10,000 individuals as patrons, and approximately 200 individuals as a combination of paid and volunteer artists. The programs were provided at our mission valley facility, in addition to 11 county libraries, caroling performances at Noah Homes. We also continued to offer our Living Room Readers program, which serves a weekly gathering of on average 12 individuals.</Desc>
